  ($$Douce France The School of Magic French Holiday Camp, 3-4yrs$$, $$South Kensington Camp, 35 Cromwell Road, South Kensington, SW7 2DG$$, $$SW7 2DG$$, 51.4953117, -0.176938, $$Family activities$$, $$08:00$$, $$12:00$$, $$https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=South%20Kensington%20Camp%2C%2035%20Cromwell%20Road%2C%20South%20Kensington%2C%20SW7%202DG$$, $$https://loopla.com/business/douce-france-london/douce-france-french-holiday-camp/31696$$, $$http://doucefrancelondon.com/$$, 5, null, 0, $$Suitable for: 3, 4$$, $$London$$, '{}', $$Times and availability sourced from Loopla. Check Loopla before travelling.$$, $$In our camps, we create a safe and caring environment in which your children can grow and develop with confidence. We believe that the holiday period is a special time for children to continue their learning and development outside of school. Through artistic, creative, fun and physical activities, they will strengthen their language skills, their memory, their attention and creativity, the discovery and control of their body, and also their social skills. OUR STORY DOUCE FRANCE LONDON is offering french holiday camps, french private tutoring and corporate language services. The name Douce France London is inspired by the song of the famous French singer Charles Trenet. The singer recalls his childhood memories. It is by going back to my childhood memories that the desire to create a convivial family company was born. Pleasant and happy memories from our childhood, nourish and comfort us. They bring back past emotions that we rediscover in our present lives. Colours, sounds and flavours also bring back sweet memories. My own memory takes me back to the games in the schoolyard, the books I loved to devour, the imaginary stories that transported me to fantastic worlds. Today, we want$$, $$GBP 49.50 from Loopla$$, true, $$Loopla London events and activities$$, $$https://loopla.com/business/douce-france-london/douce-france-french-holiday-camp/31696$$, 