  ($$London: Peppa Pig Afternoon Tea Bus Tour$$, $$Temple Embankment Bus Stop N, Temple Place, Temple, WC2R 2PH$$, $$WC2R 2PH$$, 51.5110321, -0.1137117, $$Stay & play$$, $$12:15$$, $$13:45$$, $$https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Temple%20Embankment%20Bus%20Stop%20N%2C%20Temple%20Place%2C%20Temple%2C%20WC2R%202PH$$, $$https://loopla.com/business/brigit-s-bakery/london-peppa-pig-afternoon-tea-bus-tour/31501$$, $$http://b-bakery.com/$$, 5, null, 0, $$Suitable for: 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7$$, $$London$$, '{}', $$Times and availability sourced from Loopla. Check Loopla before travelling.$$, $$See the best of London as you ride aboard an iconic double-decker Routemaster bus. Enjoy a Peppa Pig afternoon-themed tea experience with traditional British treats and unlimited hot drinks. Highlights • Feel in awe as you experience an entertaining Peppa Pig afternoon tea bus • Enjoy an afternoon tea full of British classics that your taste buds will love • Marvel at Big Ben, Piccadilly Circus, and other famous sites • Immerse yourself in a fun, interactive experience that you won't forget • Listen to Peppa Pig guided animations with singalong songs, activities, and more About Peppa Pig Afternoon Tea Bus Tour Enjoy the best views of Central London on a double-decker Routemaster bus while enjoying a Peppa Pig-themed afternoon tea. Listen to a Peppa Pig audio guide full of fun games and sing-a-long songs the whole family will love. Meet your host at the Somerset House. Hop on the double-decker red bus and get ready for a unique adventure. Take your seat, where your unique built-in tablet provides a Peppa Pig guided animation of the London tour itinerary and sing-a-long songs that the whole family will enjoy. Sit back, relax, and enjoy the ride as your driver takes you past Peppa’s f$$, $$GBP 55.00 from Loopla$$, true, $$Loopla London events and activities$$, $$https://loopla.com/business/brigit-s-bakery/london-peppa-pig-afternoon-tea-bus-tour/31501$$, $$https://loopla-prod-image